tools.help:
Examples:
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"evaluate","content":"Create a replacement credential, then restart the service.","questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"Does rotating the credential require restarting the service?"}}}]
  }'
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"evaluate","source":{"tool":"localFetch","query":{"path":"src/cache.ts"}},"questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"Does the source require restarting?"}}}]
  }'
  octocode clasify '{"queries":[{"operation":"models"}]}'
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"sections","resources":{"file":{"tool":"localFetch","query":{"path":"src/cache.ts"}}},"questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"Does the target require restarting?"}}}]
  }'

Input: {"queries":[…]} for fresh calls; copy {"cursor":"…"} from a continuation.

Required fields, by operation:
  evaluate  questions, operation, content
  evaluate  questions, operation, source
  models    operation
  sections  operation, resources, questions

Each form's example: octocode schema clasify --view variants

Fields: octocode schema clasify
